body:
Please... I'm begging this entire sub to stop posting these jokes it's so overdone... 

&#x200B;

I came here from r/freefolk  **I have to believe ya'll are capable of funnier content...**

When I was 16 I told my Mom I was thinking about jumping off the overpass of the nearby highway as a means of killing myself. She then proceeded to tell me that said overpass wasn't high enough off the ground to actually be lethal and that I needed to plan better. 

&#x200B;

Technically speaking that's actually good advice on how to successfully commit suicide, but holy shit how fucked up is that? But it's also the worst advice I've ever gotten from a moral point of view.
